        "title": "ci(deadcode): refresh unused-export baseline for banner and menu-surface exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nEvery fresh PR currently fails the `check-dependencies` lane: the new knip unused-exports ratchet (#105595) is a PR-only gate, so mainline landings that add or remove exports drift the checked-in baseline without failing anywhere. Right now `pnpm deadcode:exports` fails on main itself (`src/cli/claw-banner.ts: testing` from #105540 and `ui/src/components/menu-surface.ts: MenuSurface` from #105598), blocking all in-flight PRs (e.g. #105594, #105604).\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n`pnpm deadcode:exports:update` regenerated on current main; the baseline gains the two entries introduced by post-#105595 landings. No code change.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNone at runtime; unblocks CI for all open PRs.\n\n## Evidence\n\nOn current main, `pnpm deadcode:exports` fails with the two entries above; with this refresh it reports `baseline matched 6015 entries`.\n",
